    "theorem": "GeometricPrincipalDivisorAudit.geometric_principal_divisor_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem geometric_principal_divisor_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (f : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0), divisorDegree W (functionDivisor W f hf) = 0) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (f : W.FunctionField) (_ : f ≠ 0), NoPoles W f ↔ ∃ c : K, c ≠ 0 ∧ f = constantHom W c) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (f : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0), functionDivisor W f hf = 0 ↔ ∃ c : K, c ≠ 0 ∧ f = constantHom W c) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (f g : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0) (hg : g ≠ 0), functionDivisor W f hf = functionDivisor W g hg ↔ ∃ c : K, c ≠ 0 ∧ f = constantHom W c * g) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (f g : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0) (hg : g ≠ 0), functionDivisor W f hf = functionDivisor W g hg → InfinityMonic W f → InfinityMonic W g → f = g) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (P : W.Point) (i j : ℕ), millerFunction W P (i + j) = millerFunction W P i * millerFunction W P j * stepFunction W (i • P) (j • P)) ∧ divisorDegree rationalCurve (functionDivisor rationalCurve numeratorFunction numerator_function_nonzero) = -4 ∧ geometricControlCurve.Δ ≠ 0 ∧ divisorDegree geometricControlCurve (functionDivisor geometricControlCurve (verticalFunction geometricControlCurve 0) (vertical_nonzero geometricControlCurve 0)) = 0 ∧ rationalFunction ≠ (1 : rationalCurve.FunctionField) ∧ functionDivisor rationalCurve rationalFunction rational_function_nonzero = functionDivisor rationalCurve 1 one_ne_zero ∧ InfinityMonic rationalCurve rationalFunction ∧ InfinityMonic rationalCurve (1 : rationalCurve.FunctionField)",
    "decl_sha256": "87af23f53b8644b39d35a8d39e7b83e65d5a5c4e15b785494cadc5bab49e10dd",
    "scope": "Actual geometric elliptic principal-divisor degreezero, constant kernel and normalized uniqueness for every FieldK/IsAlgClosedK and actual general Weierstrass model with actual discriminantnonzero, every characteristic including2/3, every actual nonzero FunctionField element. Actual integer coefficient-sum divisorDegree additive homomorphism and point-permutation invariance. Actual constants have zero point divisor. Algebraic closure gives actual nonsingular point over every x; actual vertical divisors plus actual split-polynomial factorization give polynomial-function degreezero. Actual full-field normfraction and negation divisor identity imply 2timesactualdegree=0 inintegers, hence actualdegreezero; no degree premise or inverseof2inK. Actual infinity chart residue/localization/maximalideal maps derive coefficient constant approximation for every actual infinityregular function. Actual no-poles subtraction and nonnegative degreezero coefficients imply no-poles iff nonzero constant, zeroactualdivisor iff nonzero constant and equalactualdivisors iff nonzero scalar multiple, without globalregularityclassification premise. Actual leading-residue-one normalization gives uniqueness, anyvalidMillerfunctionequalschosen and exact chosenall-n i+jaddition identity includingzero/vertical branches. Actual prior nonsingularF3curve y²=x³+x+1: nonzero polynomialX²+1 has rational-onlydivisor−4(O)/degree−4, refuting deletedgeometricpointscope. Actual priornormalizednonconstantzero-rational-divisor ratio versus1 reconstructs rational-onlynormalizeduniqueness counter. Actualcoefficient-mappedellipticmodeloveractualAlgebraicClosureF3 has discriminantnonzero/verticaldegreezero, realizesgeometricguards. Elliptic geometric specialization of Galbraith7.7.11/Cor7.7.13/7.7.14 survives, notallcurves theorem.58modules47exactcredited+11new/defaults/standardfoundations. Generalfunctionfield/pointdivisor basechange-descent, separateScheme.localRing/Divisor APIinterop, translation/reciprocity/isogeny/Lang/Cartier/Jacobian/canonicalWeilTate/MOVFR/binaryruntime/full14 remainopen. Samehost/prover/Mathlib/nativeheaderprocedural/notcompiler-parser-physicalhostrefinement. No novelty/canonicalpromotion/signedstandingclaim.",
